[2026-05-22 10:42:29] [INFO] [UNKNOWN] Input: {"session_id":"76b18e87-c13b-4314-b425-4330e88469ac","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\EDY\\.claude\\projects\\D--development-code-opencode-claude-hk\\76b18e87-c13b-4314-b425-4330e88469ac.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolBatch","tool_calls":[{"tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\development\\code\\opencode\\claude-hk\\doc\\issues\\drafts\\2026-05-21-optimize-issue-discussion-pr-templates.md"},"tool_use_id":"call_5a8415b531bf48d483973ea5","tool_response":"1\t---\n2\ttitle: 优化 Issue 初始模板、讨论模板和 PR 模板\n3\tlabels: skill-system,enhancement,documentation\n4\tassignee: \n5\tpriority: P1\n6\tstatus: draft\n7\tcreated: 2026-05-21\n8\t---\n9\t\n10\t## 描述\n11\t\n12\t当前项目的模板体系较为简单：\n13\t- Issue 模板仅有 `tpl_bug.md` 和 `tpl_feature.md` 两个基础 Markdown 模板\n14\t- 无 PR 模板（`PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md`）\n15\t- 无 Discussion（讨论）模板\n16\t\n17\t对比业界主流开源项目的模板实践，存在以下差距：\n18\t1. **Issue 模板缺少结构化表单**，用户填写随意，信息质量参差不齐\n19\t2. **无 PR 模板**，提 PR 时缺乏统一的变更描述和测试计划引导\n20\t3. **无 Discussion 模板**，功能讨论、求助等场景缺少结构化引导\n21\t4. **所有模板均为 Markdown 格式**，未使用 GitHub 表单（YAML）能力\n22\t\n23\t---\n24\t\n25\t## 网络调研：具体模板示例\n26\t\n27\t### 一、Issue 模板示例\n28\t\n29\t#### 1.1 Markdown 模板 —— VSCode（注释引导式）\n30\t\n31\t**来源**：https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md\n32\t\n33\t```markdown\n34\t---\n35\tname: Bug report\n36\tabout: Create a report to help us improve\n37\ttitle: ''\n38\tlabels: ''\n39\tassignees: ''\n40\t---\n41\t\n42\t<!-- ⚠️⚠️ Do Not Delete This! bug_report_template ⚠️⚠️ -->\n43\t<!-- Please read our Rules of Conduct: https://opensource.microsoft.com/codeofconduct/ -->\n44\t<!-- 🔎 Search existing issues to avoid creating duplicates. -->\n45\t<!-- 🧪 Test using the latest Insiders build... -->\n46\tDoes this issue occur when all extensions are disabled?: Yes/No\n47\t\n48\t- VS Code Version: \n49\t- OS Version: \n50\t\n51\tSteps to Reproduce:\n52\t\n53\t1. \n54\t2.\n55\t```\n56\t\n57\t**特点**：大量使用 HTML 注释 `<!-- -->` 作为填写引导，不干扰最终渲染；预置问题（扩展是否禁用）快速定位根因。\n58\t\n59\t---\n60\t\n61\t#### 1.2 Markdown 模板 —— React（标题前缀 + 预置标签）\n62\t\n63\t**来源**：https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.md\n64\t\n65\t```markdown\n66\t---\n67\tname: \"🐛 Bug Report\"\n68\tabout: Report a reproducible bug or regression.\n69\ttitle: 'Bug: '\n70\tlabels: 'Status: Unconfirmed'\n71\t---\n72\t\n73\tReact version:\n74\t\n75\t## Steps To Reproduce\n76\t\n77\t1.\n78\t2.\n79\t\n80\tLink to code example:\n81\t\n82\t## The current behavior\n83\t\n84\t## The expected behavior\n85\t```\n86\t\n87\t**特点**：`title: 'Bug: '` 强制标题前缀；`labels: 'Status: Unconfirmed'` 自动打标签；明确强调无复现步骤可能被直接关闭。\n88\t\n89\t---\n90\t\n91\t#### 1.3 YAML 表单模板 —— React Compiler（分类复选框 + 必填验证）\n92\t\n93\t**来源**：https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/compiler_bug_report.yml\n94\t\n95\t```yaml\n96\tname: \"⚛️ ✨ Compiler bug report\"\n97\tdescription: \"Report a problem with React Compiler...\"\n98\ttitle: \"[Compiler Bug]: \"\n99\tlabels: [\"Component: Optimizing Compiler\", \"Type: Bug\", \"Status: Unconfirmed\"]\n100\tbody:\n101\t- type: checkboxes\n102\t  attributes:\n103\t    label: What kind of issue is this?\n104\t    options:\n105\t      - label: React Compiler core...\n106\t      - label: babel-plugin-react-compiler...\n107\t      - label: eslint-plugin-react-hooks...\n108\t- type: input\n109\t  attributes:\n110\t    label: Link to repro\n111\t    placeholder: public GitHub repo, or Playground link\n112\t  validations:\n113\t    required: true\n114\t- type: textarea\n115\t  attributes:\n116\t    label: Repro steps\n117\t    placeholder: |\n118\t      1. Log in with username/password\n119\t      2. Click \"Messages\"...\n120\t  validations:\n121\t    required: true\n122\t- type: dropdown\n123\t  attributes:\n124\t    label: How often does this bug happen?\n125\t    options:\n126\t      - Every time\n127\t      - Often\n128\t      - Sometimes\n129\t      - Only once\n130\t  validations:\n131\t    required: true\n132\t```\n133\t\n134\t**特点**：`checkboxes` 分类问题类型；`input` 强制复现链接；`dropdown` 量化频率；所有关键字段均 `required: true`。\n135\t\n136\t---\n137\t\n138\t#### 1.4 YAML 表单模板 —— Next.js（环境命令自动收集 + 多选下拉）\n139\t\n140\t**来源**：https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/1.bug_report.yml\n141\t\n142\t```yaml\n143\tname: Report an issue\n144\tdescription: Report a Next.js issue.\n145\ttype: Bug\n146\tbody:\n147\t  - type: markdown\n148\t    attributes:\n149\t      value: |\n150\t        Before opening a new issue, please do a search of existing issues...\n151\t        If you need help, start a discussion in the [\"Help\"](...) section.\n152\t  - type: input\n153\t    attributes:\n154\t      label: Link to the code that reproduces this issue\n155\t      description: |\n156\t        A link to a public GitHub repository or CodeSandbox minimal reproduction.\n157\t        **Skipping this will result in the issue being closed.**\n158\t      placeholder: 'https://github.com/user/my-reproduction'\n159\t    validations:\n160\t      required: true\n161\t  - type: textarea\n162\t    attributes:\n163\t      label: To Reproduce\n164\t      placeholder: |\n165\t        1. Start the application in development\n166\t        2. Click X\n167\t        3. Y will happen\n168\t    validations:\n169\t      required: true\n170\t  - type: textarea\n171\t    attributes:\n172\t      label: Current vs. Expected behavior\n173\t      placeholder: 'I expected A, but observed B'\n174\t    validations:\n175\t      required: true\n176\t  - type: textarea\n177\t    attributes:\n178\t      label: Provide environment information\n179\t      description: Please run `next info` and paste the results.\n180\t      render: bash\n181\t    validations:\n182\t      required: true\n183\t  - type: dropdown\n184\t    attributes:\n185\t      label: Which area(s) are affected?\n186\t      multiple: true\n187\t      options:\n188\t        - 'CSS'\n189\t        - 'Image (next/image)'\n190\t        - 'Middleware'\n191\t        - 'Server Actions'\n192\t        - ...\n193\t    validations:\n194\t      required: true\n195\t```\n196\t\n197\t**特点**：`render: bash` 格式化环境输出；`multiple: true` 多选下拉精确归类；顶部 Markdown 区块引导用户先去 Discussion 求助。\n198\t\n199\t---\n200\t\n201\t#### 1.5 YAML 表单模板 —— Vite（验证勾选框 + 行为约束）\n202\t\n203\t**来源**：https://github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml\n204\t\n205\t```yaml\n206\tname: \"🐞 Bug report\"\n207\tdescription: Report an issue with Vite\n208\tlabels: [pending triage]\n209\ttype: Bug\n210\tbody:\n211\t  - type: textarea\n212\t    id: bug-description\n213\t    attributes:\n214\t      label: Describe the bug\n215\t      placeholder: I am doing ... What I expect is ... What actually happening is ...\n216\t    validations:\n217\t      required: true\n218\t  - type: input\n219\t    id: reproduction\n220\t    attributes:\n221\t      label: Reproduction\n222\t      description: |\n223\t        A minimal reproduction is required. If no reproduction is provided after 3 days, it will be auto-closed.\n224\t      placeholder: Reproduction URL\n225\t    validations:\n226\t      required: true\n227\t  - type: dropdown\n228\t    id: package-manager\n229\t    attributes:\n230\t      label: Used Package Manager\n231\t      options:\n232\t        - npm\n233\t        - yarn\n234\t        - pnpm\n235\t        - bun\n236\t    validations:\n237\t      required: true\n238\t  - type: checkboxes\n239\t    id: checkboxes\n240\t    attributes:\n241\t      label: Validations\n242\t      description: Before submitting, please make sure you do the following\n243\t      options:\n244\t        - label: Follow our Code of Conduct\n245\t          required: true\n246\t        - label: Read the Contributing Guidelines\n247\t          required: true\n248\t        - label: Check that there isn't already an issue\n249\t          required: true\n250\t        - label: Make sure this is a Vite issue and not framework-specific\n251\t          required: true\n252\t        - label: The provided reproduction is minimal\n253\t          required: true\n254\t```\n255\t\n256\t**特点**：`checkboxes` 带 `required: true` 选项，用户必须勾选才能提交；复现链接缺失明确告知 3 天后自动关闭。\n257\t\n258\t---\n259\t\n260\t#### 1.6 YAML 表单模板 —— Prisma（严重程度 + 频率 + 回归检测）\n261\t\n262\t**来源**：https://github.com/prisma/prisma/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml\n263\t\n264\t```yaml\n265\tname: Bug report\n266\tlabels: ['kind/bug']\n267\tbody:\n268\t  - type: dropdown\n269\t    id: severity\n270\t    attributes:\n271\t      label: Severity\n272\t      options:\n273\t        - '🚨 Critical: Data loss, app crash, security issue'\n274\t        - '⚠️ Major: Breaks core functionality'\n275\t        - '🔹 Minor: Unexpected behavior'\n276\t    validations:\n277\t      required: true\n278\t  - type: dropdown\n279\t    id: frequency\n280\t    attributes:\n281\t      label: Frequency\n282\t      options:\n283\t        - 'Consistently reproducible'\n284\t        - 'Intermittent / Random'\n285\t        - 'Happened once'\n286\t    validations:\n287\t      required: true\n288\t  - type: textarea\n289\t    id: regression\n290\t    attributes:\n291\t      label: Is this a regression?\n292\t      value: |\n293\t        <!-- e.g., \"Yes, last worked in Prisma 5.1.0\" -->\n294\t    validations:\n295\t      required: true\n296\t  - type: textarea\n297\t    id: workaround\n298\t    attributes:\n299\t      label: Workaround\n300\t      value: |\n301\t        <!-- e.g., \"Downgrading fixes it\" or \"No workaround\" -->\n302\t    validations:\n303\t      required: true\n304\t```\n305\t\n306\t**特点**：`Severity` + `Frequency` 双下拉，帮助维护者快速判断优先级；强制询问是否回归 + 是否有 workaround，减少重复提问。\n307\t\n308\t---\n309\t\n310\t#### 1.7 YAML 表单模板 —— Rust（当前输出 vs 期望输出对比）\n311\t\n312\t**来源**：https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/diagnostics.yaml\n313\t\n314\t```yaml\n315\tname: Diagnostic issue\n316\tdescription: Create a bug report for rustc's error output\n317\tlabels: [\"A-diagnostics\", \"T-compiler\"]\n318\tbody:\n319\t  - type: textarea\n320\t    id: code\n321\t    attributes:\n322\t      label: Code\n323\t      render: Rust\n324\t    validations:\n325\t      required: true\n326\t  - type: textarea\n327\t    id: output\n328\t    attributes:\n329\t      label: Current output\n330\t      render: Shell\n331\t    validations:\n332\t      required: true\n333\t  - type: textarea\n334\t    id: desired-output\n335\t    attributes:\n336\t      label: Desired output\n337\t      render: Shell\n338\t    validations:\n339\t      required: false\n340\t  - type: textarea\n341\t    id: version\n342\t    attributes:\n343\t      label: Rust Version\n344\t      placeholder: |\n345\t        $ rustc --version --verbose\n346\t        rustc 1.XX.Y ...\n347\t      render: Shell\n348\t    validations:\n349\t      required: true\n350\t```\n351\t\n352\t**特点**：`render: Rust` / `render: Shell` 代码高亮；\"Current output\" 与 \"Desired output\" 对比式结构，特别适合编译器/诊断类问题。\n353\t\n354\t---\n355\t\n356\t#### 1.8 YAML 表单模板 —— shadcn/ui（组件级影响范围）\n357\t\n358\t**来源**：https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml\n359\t\n360\t```yaml\n361\tname: \"Bug report\"\n362\ttitle: '[bug]: '\n363\tlabels: [\"bug\"]\n364\tbody:\n365\t  - type: input\n366\t    id: components-affected\n367\t    attributes:\n368\t      label: Affected component/components\n369\t      placeholder: ex. Button, Checkbox...\n370\t    validations:\n371\t      required: true\n372\t  - type: input\n373\t    id: codesandbox-stackblitz\n374\t    attributes:\n375\t      label: Codesandbox/StackBlitz link\n376\t      description: |\n377\t        > [!CAUTION]\n378\t        > If you skip this, this issue might be labeled with `please add a reproduction` and closed.\n379\t  - type: checkboxes\n380\t    id: terms\n381\t    attributes:\n382\t      label: Before submitting\n383\t      options:\n384\t        - label: I've made research efforts and searched the documentation\n385\t          required: true\n386\t        - label: I've searched for existing issues\n387\t          required: true\n388\t```\n389\t\n390\t**特点**：组件库特有字段 \"Affected component/components\"；`[!CAUTION]` 警告区块强调复现的重要性。\n391\t\n392\t---\n393\t\n394\t### 二、Discussion 模板示例\n395\t\n396\t#### 2.1 Next.js —— Feature Request Discussion（Goals / Non-Goals / Background / Proposal）\n397\t\n398\t**来源**：https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/.github/DISCUSSION_TEMPLATE/ideas.yml\n399\t\n400\t```yaml\n401\tbody:\n402\t  - type: textarea\n403\t    attributes:\n404\t      label: Goals\n405\t      description: Short list of what the feature request aims to address?\n406\t      value: |\n407\t        1.\n408\t        2.\n409\t        3.\n410\t    validations:\n411\t      required: true\n412\t  - type: textarea\n413\t    attributes:\n414\t      label: Non-Goals\n415\t      description: Short list of what the feature request does not aim to address?\n416\t      value: |\n417\t        1.\n418\t        2.\n419\t        3.\n420\t    validations:\n421\t      required: false\n422\t  - type: textarea\n423\t    attributes:\n424\t      label: Background\n425\t      description: Discuss prior art, why do you think this feature is needed?\n426\t    validations:\n427\t      required: true\n428\t  - type: textarea\n429\t    attributes:\n430\t      label: Proposal\n431\t      description: How should this feature be implemented? Are you interested in contributing?\n432\t    validations:\n433\t      required: true\n434\t```\n435\t\n436\t**特点**：`Goals / Non-Goals` 双栏结构明确需求边界，避免范围蔓延；`Background` 强制做 prior art 调研；`Proposal` 鼓励社区贡献。\n437\t\n438\t---\n439\t\n440\t#### 2.2 Next.js —— Help Discussion\n441\t\n442\t**来源**：https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/.github/DISCUSSION_TEMPLATE/help.yml\n443\t\n444\t```yaml\n445\tbody:\n446\t  - type: textarea\n447\t    attributes:\n448\t      label: Summary\n449\t      description: What do you need help with?\n450\t    validations:\n451\t      required: true\n452\t  - type: textarea\n453\t    attributes:\n454\t      label: Additional information\n455\t      description: Any code snippets, error messages... (`next info`)\n456\t      render: js\n457\t  - type: input\n458\t    attributes:\n459\t      label: Example\n460\t      description: A link to a minimal reproduction is helpful!\n461\t```\n462\t\n463\t**特点**：简洁三字段，降低求助门槛；`render: js` 鼓励粘贴代码而非截图。\n464\t\n465\t---\n466\t\n467\t### 三、PR 模板示例\n468\t\n469\t#### 3.1 React —— 强调\"如何测试此变更\"\n470\t\n471\t**来源**：https://github.com/facebook/react/blob/main/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md\n472\t\n473\t```markdown\n474\t<!--\n475\t  Before submitting:\n476\t  1. Fork the repository and create your branch from `main`.\n477\t  2. Run `yarn` in the repository root.\n478\t  3. If you've fixed a bug or added code that should be tested, add tests!\n479\t  4. Ensure the test suite passes (`yarn test`).\n480\t  5. Run `yarn test --prod` to test in production environment.\n481\t  6. Format your code with prettier (`yarn prettier`).\n482\t  7. Make sure your code lints (`yarn lint`).\n483\t  8. Run Flow type checks (`yarn flow`).\n484\t  9. If you haven't already, complete the CLA.\n485\t-->\n486\t\n487\t## Summary\n488\t<!-- Explain the motivation for making this change... -->\n489\t\n490\t## How did you test this change?\n491\t<!--\n492\t  Demonstrate the code is solid. Example: The exact commands you ran and their output.\n493\t  If you leave this empty, your PR will very likely be closed.\n494\t-->\n495\t```\n496\t\n497\t**特点**：头部 9 步贡献清单注释，**留空 `How did you test this change?` 可能导致 PR 被直接关闭**。\n498\t\n499\t---\n500\t\n501\t#### 3.2 Kubernetes —— PR 类型标记 + 发布说明\n502\t\n503\t**来源**：https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/master/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md\n504\t\n505\t```markdown\n506\t#### What type of PR is this?\n507\t<!--\n508\t/kind bug\n509\t/kind feature\n510\t/kind cleanup\n511\t/kind documentation\n512\t-->\n513\t\n514\t#### What this PR does / why we need it:\n515\t\n516\t#### Which issue(s) this PR is related to:\n517\t<!-- Fixes #<issue number> -->\n518\t\n519\t#### Special notes for your reviewer:\n520\t\n521\t#### Does this PR introduce a user-facing change?\n522\t```release-note\n523\t\n524\t```\n525\t\n526\t#### Additional documentation e.g., KEPs...\n527\t```docs\n528\t\n529\t```\n530\t```\n531\t\n532\t**特点**：`kind` 标记标准化（与 Prow 机器人集成）；`release-note` 代码块强制填写发布说明；`docs` 代码块关联文档变更。\n533\t\n534\t---\n535\t\n536\t#### 3.3 Astro —— Changes / Testing / Docs 三段式\n537\t\n538\t**来源**：https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/main/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md\n539\t\n540\t```markdown\n541\t## Changes\n542\t- What does this change?\n543\t- Be short and concise. Bullet points can help!\n544\t- Don't forget a changeset! Run `pnpm changeset`.\n545\t\n546\t## Testing\n547\t<!-- How was this change tested? -->\n548\t<!-- DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION! If no tests added, explain why. -->\n549\t\n550\t## Docs\n551\t<!-- Could this affect a user's behavior? We probably need to update docs! -->\n552\t<!-- DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION! If no docs added, explain why.-->\n553\t```\n554\t\n555\t**特点**：极简三段式，强调 `changeset`（版本变更日志）；`DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION!` 强制保留每个区块。\n556\t\n557\t---\n558\t\n559\t#### 3.4 Vite —— 注释引导式（不渲染到最终 PR）\n560\t\n561\t**来源**：https://github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/main/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md\n562\t\n563\t```markdown\n564\t<!--\n565\t- What is this PR solving? Write a clear and concise description.\n566\t- Reference the issues it solves (e.g. `fixes #123`).\n567\t- What other alternatives have you explored?\n568\t- Are there any parts you think require more attention from reviewers?\n569\t\n570\tAlso, please make sure you do the following:\n571\t- Read the Contributing Guidelines...\n572\t- Check that there isn't already a PR that solves the problem...\n573\t- Update the corresponding documentation if needed.\n574\t- Include relevant tests that fail without this PR but pass with it.\n575\t  If the tests are not included, explain why.\n576\t-->\n577\t```\n578\t\n579\t**特点**：**纯注释模板**，PR 描述初始为空白，完全由贡献者自行填写；避免模板残留污染 PR 正文。\n580\t\n581\t---\n582\t\n583\t### 四、Issue 配置示例（config.yml）\n584\t\n585\t#### 4.1 Next.js —— 引导 Feature Request 到 Discussion\n586\t\n587\t**来源**：https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml\n588\t\n589\t```yaml\n590\tblank_issues_enabled: false\n591\tcontact_links:\n592\t  - name: Ask a question or discuss a topic\n593\t    url: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/discussions\n594\t    about: Ask questions or discuss with other Next.js users in discussions.\n595\t  - name: Feature or documentation request\n596\t    url: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/discussions/new?category=ideas\n597\t    about: Open a feature or documentation request in discussions.\n598\t```\n599\t\n600\t**特点**：`blank_issues_enabled: false` 禁止空白 Issue；`contact_links` 将 Feature Request 和求助全部引导到 Discussion。\n601\t\n602\t---\n603\t\n604\t## 调研结论\n605\t\n606\t### 业界趋势\n607\t\n608\t1. **YAML 表单化**：大型项目（React、Next.js、Astro、Vite、Prisma、Rust）已全面转向 `.yml` 表单模板\n609\t2. **Feature Request 移入 Discussion**：Next.js、React 等将功能请求从 Issue 转移到 GitHub Discussion，减少 Issue 噪音\n610\t3. **PR 模板强调\"测试证明\"**：React PR 模板明确要求 `How did you test this change?`，留空可能被关闭\n611\t4. **检查清单（Checklist）普及**：Vite、shadcn-ui 等使用 `checkboxes` 强制用户确认前置条件\n612\t5. **环境信息自动化**：Next.js、Astro 要求运行 CLI 命令（`next info`、`astro info`）并粘贴输出\n613\t6. **严重程度分级**：Prisma 使用 Severity + Frequency 双下拉帮助维护者快速判断优先级\n614\t\n615\t### Markdown vs YAML 对比\n616\t\n617\t| 维度 | Markdown 模板 | YAML 表单模板 |\n618\t|------|--------------|---------------|\n619\t| 用户填写体验 | 自由编辑，容易遗漏 | 结构化输入，必填校验 |\n620\t| 信息质量 | 参差不齐 | 较高，强制关键字段 |\n621\t| 维护复杂度 | 低 | 中（需学习 YAML 语法） |\n622\t| GitHub 原生支持 | 基础支持 | 完整支持（下拉、复选框、文本域） |\n623\t| 适用场景 | 简单项目、Agent 生成 | 多人协作、社区贡献 |\n624\t\n625\t---\n626\t\n627\t## 方案设计\n628\t\n629\t### 方案 A：全面 YAML 表单化（对标 Next.js / Astro）\n630\t\n631\t全面采用 GitHub YAML 表单，将 Issue 模板、Discussion 模板全部表单化。\n632\t\n633\t**Issue 模板（YAML）：**\n634\t- `bug_report.yml` —— 复现链接（必填）、复现步骤、当前/期望行为、环境信息、影响范围\n635\t- `feature_request.yml` —— 需求背景、期望行为、实现思路、是否愿意贡献 PR\n636\t- `documentation.yml` —— 文档位置、问题描述、建议修改\n637\t\n638\t**Discussion 模板（YAML）：**\n639\t- `ideas.yml` —— Goals / Non-Goals / Background / Proposal（对标 Next.js）\n640\t- `help.yml` —— 问题描述、已尝试方案、环境信息、最小复现\n641\t\n642\t**PR 模板（Markdown + 检查清单）：**\n643\t- 变更摘要、关联 Issue、Test Plan（检查清单）、截图/日志、Checklist（lint/test/doc）\n644\t\n645\t**优点**：\n646\t- 信息质量最高，强制字段减少来回沟通\n647\t- 业界主流，Next.js、Astro、React 均采用\n648\t- Discussion 模板可分流 Feature Request，减轻 Issue 负担\n649\t\n650\t**缺点**：\n651\t- Agent 自动生成 Issue/PR 时需额外处理 YAML 表单字段\n652\t- 需要学习 GitHub 表单语法\n653\t\n654\t---\n655\t\n656\t### 方案 B：Markdown + YAML 混合（平衡易用与规范）⭐\n657\t\n658\t**Issue 模板：**\n659\t- Agent 生成的 Issue 保持现有 Markdown 模板（便于程序化填充）\n660\t- 面向人类用户的 GitHub Issue 使用 YAML 表单模板\n661\t- 双轨并行：Markdown 用于 Agent 草稿，YAML 用于最终发布\n662\t\n663\t**Discussion 模板（YAML）：**\n664\t- 仅保留 `ideas.yml`，用于功能讨论\n665\t\n666\t**PR 模板（Markdown，增强版）：**\n667\t- 在现有 PR 格式基础上，增加：\n668\t  - 头部 HTML 注释引导（对标 VSCode）\n669\t  - 更详细的 Test Plan 区块\n670\t  - 关联 Issue 自动关闭说明\n671\t\n672\t**优点**：\n673\t- 兼顾 Agent 自动化和人类用户友好性\n674\t- 改动成本最低，可渐进式升级\n675\t- 保留现有 Markdown 模板资产\n676\t\n677\t**缺点**：\n678\t- 双轨维护成本稍高\n679\t- 对人类用户的强制力不如纯 YAML\n680\t\n681\t---\n682\t\n683\t### 方案 C：轻量统一 Markdown（最小改动）\n684\t\n685\t全部使用 Markdown 模板，不引入 YAML 表单，但统一增强现有模板结构。\n686\t\n687\t**Issue 模板增强：**\n688\t- `tpl_bug.md`：增加\"复现链接\"、\"影响范围\"、\"优先级自评\"区块\n689\t- `tpl_feature.md`：增加\"Goals / Non-Goals\"、\"替代方案\"、\"是否愿意实现\"区块\n690\t- 新增 `tpl_discussion.md`：用于功能讨论前的方案预研\n691\t\n692\t**PR 模板（新建）：**\n693\t- 简单 Markdown，包含：Summary / Changes / Test Plan / Checklist / Closes #N\n694\t\n695\t**优点**：\n696\t- 实现最简单，无需学习 YAML\n697\t- Agent 生成最方便，直接字符串拼接\n698\t- 与现有 `003-2-issue` skill 草稿格式完全兼容\n699\t\n700\t**缺点**：\n701\t- 无法强制必填字段\n702\t- 信息质量依赖填写者自觉\n703\t- 与业界趋势有一定差距\n704\t\n705\t---\n706\t\n707\t## 决策对比\n708\t\n709\t| 决策点 | 方案 A | 方案 B ⭐ | 方案 C |\n710\t|--------|--------|----------|--------|\n711\t| Issue 模板格式 | YAML 表单 | Markdown（Agent）+ YAML（人类） | Markdown |\n712\t| PR 模板 | Markdown 增强 | Markdown 增强 | Markdown 基础 |\n713\t| Discussion 模板 | YAML 表单 | YAML 表单（仅 ideas） | Markdown |\n714\t| 对 Agent 友好度 | 中 | **高** | 最高 |\n715\t| 对人类用户友好度 | **最高** | 高 | 中 |\n716\t| 维护成本 | 中 | 中 | **低** |\n717\t| 信息强制力 | 强 | 中 | 弱 |\n718\t\n719\t---\n720\t\n721\t## 涉及文件\n722\t\n723\t| 文件 | 改动说明 |\n724\t|------|---------|\n725\t| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml` | 新增人类用户 Bug 报告 YAML 表单 |\n726\t| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml` | 新增人类用户 Feature Request YAML 表单 |\n727\t| `.github/DISCUSSION_TEMPLATE/ideas.yml` | 新增功能讨论 YAML 表单 |\n728\t| `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` | 新增 PR 模板 |\n729\t| `doc/issues/templates/tpl_bug.md` | 增强：增加复现链接、影响范围等 |\n730\t| `doc/issues/templates/tpl_feature.md` | 增强：增加 Goals/Non-Goals、替代方案等 |\n731\t| `.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml` | 新增：配置 Issue 创建引导，指向 Discussion |\n732\t\n733\t## 验收标准\n734\t\n735\t- [ ] 确定最终方案（A / B / C）\n736\t- [ ] PR 模板已创建并包含：Summary、Changes、Test Plan、Checklist、关联 Issue\n737\t- [ ] Issue YAML 表单（如选 A/B）已配置必填字段验证\n738\t- [ ] Discussion 模板（如选 A/B）已配置 Goals/Background/Proposal 结构\n739\t- [ ] 现有 Markdown 模板已同步增强\n740\t- [ ] `config.yml` 已配置（引导 Feature Request 到 Discussion）\n741\t\n742\t## 发布记录\n743\t\n744\t- Issue #17: https://github.com/xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk/issues/17 (发布于 2026-05-21 22:31)\n745\t\n746\t"}]}
